  "metadata": {
    "title": "Helmets Kenya Crop Type Dataset",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15467063",
    "publication_date": "2025-05-19",
    "description": "<p>Georeferenced crop-type dataset (Helmets_Kenya_v2.csv) with associated roadside imagery (KENYA_v2.zip) from 16 counties in Kenya in 2021 and 2022. The dataset consists of over 6000 crop type points which were created via Helmet-Mounted Cameras and Deep Learning.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Acknowledgements</strong><br>This work was funded by Lacuna Fund Project NO. 2020-01-202 -&ldquo;Helmets Labeling Crops&ldquo;. Additional Support for data collection in Kneya from the NASA Harvest program No. 80NSSC23M0032, NASA SERVIR Grant No. 80NSSC20K0264, and SwissRe Foundation Grant EO-NAM. Partner organizations in implementation testing included NAACRI (Uganda), RCMRD (Kenya, Zambia), Makerere (Uganda), Milsat (Nigeria), NARSDA (Nigeria).</p>",
